  "summary": "Preinstall downloads Bun runtime to execute obfuscated bundled payload",
  "details": "The package's preinstall script (scripts.preinstall = \"node setup.mjs\") downloads the Bun runtime from a GitHub releases URL, extracts and chmods the binary, and invokes it via execFileSync to run a sibling file math_init.js. math_init.js is a ~720 KB single-line Bun-CJS bundle using rotated string-array obfuscation (hex-named identifiers, string-array rotator) and is not referenced from dist/index.js or any advertised entry point. The alternate runtime is used specifically to execute code that Node-oriented tooling will not evaluate, and the payload is unrelated to the React/Anvil UI functionality shipped in dist/. The package is published under the @servicetitan scope and otherwise resembles an internal UI component library, giving the install-time dropper cover.",
